<title>UK: NWE Europe oil, gas rigs down three at 62.</title>
<headline>NWE Europe oil, gas rigs down three at 62.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs operating offshore northwest Europe fell three to 62 last week, consultants Arthur Andersen said.</p>
<p>Rigs active in British waters fell three to 27.</p>
<p>Norwegian rigs were steady at 19. Ireland kept one rig running and the Dutch and Danish sectors were both unchanged at 10 and five respectively.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8280</p>
